## 6. 서비스 레이어

### `src/services/paymentService.ts`

```ts
import { ProviderRouter } from '../router/providerRouter';
import { PaymentRequest, PaymentResult } from '../types/payment';

export class PaymentService {
  constructor(private readonly providerRouter: ProviderRouter) {}

  async pay(request: PaymentRequest): Promise<PaymentResult> {
    const provider = this.providerRouter.getProvider(request);
    return provider.processPayment(request);
  }
}
```

서비스는 provider 구현체를 직접 알 필요가 없고, router에만 의존합니다.

